

## Overview
This project analyzes sales, costs, and discounts using Power BI. It includes:
- Treemap of sales by country
- Gauge chart for average standard cost
- Scatter plot of discount vs. order quantity
- Bar chart of sales by product category

## Files
- `AdvWorksData_cleaned.xlsx`: Cleaned dataset used in Power BI
- `SalesDashboard.pbix`: Power BI dashboard file
- `README.md`: Project documentation

